section.para:
The examples of the statement routines use a handle, db,
to an open database connection, to a database with this table:

CREATE TABLE foods(id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, type_id INTEGER, name TEXT, price REAL, picture BLOB);
INSERT INTO foods(type_id, name, price) VALUES(1, 'Bagels', 1.25);
INSERT INTO foods(type_id, name, price) VALUES(1, 'Bagels, raisin', 1.50);
INSERT INTO foods(type_id, name, price) VALUES(2, 'Bacon', 3.75);
INSERT INTO foods(type_id, name, price) VALUES(3, 'Cheese', NULL);
